data: {"id": "ff55f7c4ecaf456f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1275", "run_id": "ff55f7c4ecaf456f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有的工具结果，我来总结已采集的事实、冲突和缺口。\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` 在 `aiops-case-06` 命名空间中，状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，已重启 12 次（最近一次 4 分 9 秒前），运行时长 42 分钟，IP `172.16.104.17`，调度在 `node2`。\n\n2. **Events 证据**：`BackOff restarting failed container app`，178 次 over 41 分钟，明确证实 CrashLoopBackOff 持续存在。\n\n3. **Previous Logs（重启前的崩溃日志）**：\n   - `{\"timestamp\":1788438740.5485165,\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"runtime process exiting\",\"http_status\":500,\"path\":\"/work\",\"duration_ms\":0.003684", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788439026968, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

